Instant Noodles was added in '''Beta 44.0''' as a generated card from the '''Noodles''' [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Artifacts Artifact]. As a rather powerful 4G spell able to give +4/+4 to whoever and whenever you want, one was added to your hand at the start of the game.

'''Beta 47.1''' changed them both. The Artifact was doubled, giving 2 instead of 1, while the spell was halved to give +2/+2 for 2G. The Artifact now adds them to your deck instead of to your hand, while the spell now also lets you draw a card.

